    ontoksd:hasSpecificationPattern ontoksd:CC2020SpecificationPattern ;
    ontoksd:hasStructureType ontoksd:Atomic ;
    rdfs:comment "This competency involves the ability to abstract elements of a real-world domain and model them as formal language-based representations through explicit alphabets, strings, and languages that capture relevant structural features. Learners demonstrate this competency by: - establishing explicit mappings between domain entities and formal symbols; - defining alphabets, strings, and languages appropriate to the selected representation; - justifying modeling choices, including exclusions and simplifications; - assessing the structural adequacy of the model and identifying its formal limitations; - distinguishing structural correctness from semantic interpretation. The scope is abstraction and modeling. Operations on the resulting languages are addressed by C17, and transformations between representations by C19. Conceptual mapping supports the initial abstraction without subsuming the separate analysis of homomorphisms."@en ;
